12550   pad tap dpdown
12560   pad tap dpdown
12570   pad tap dpdown
12580   pad tap dpdown
12590   pad tap dpdown
12600   pad tap a
12620   pad tap a
12640   pad tap dpdown
12650   pad tap dpdown
12670   pad tap dpleft
12690   pad tap b
12710   pad tap b
12730   pad tap b
12770   expect menu-open=0
12770   expect core-option=virtualjaguar_internal_resolution:1x

# "More settings..." opened from the in-game menu keeps the menu underneath and hands the pad to the window only.  Down x6 is Settings,
